data: {"id": "5a9f42dbc2f6404f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1434", "run_id": "5a9f42dbc2f6404f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 实体身份与生命周期\n\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v09/workload`, UID `5746c496-b67c-4906-aabb-e71359674305`, IP `172.16.104.20`, 节点 `node2`.\n- **容器**: 单容器 `app`, 镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`.\n- **当前状态**: Pod phase `Running`, 但容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting (CrashLoopBackOff)`, `Ready=False`. 已重启 12 次.\n- **终态信息**: `Last State: Terminated`, `Reason: Error`, **Exit Code: 1**.\n\n---\n\n### 事实证据\n\n#### 1. Kubernetes 状态 (kubectl_describe / kubectl_get_yaml)\n- **支持证据**:\n    - 容器 `app` 处于 `CrashLoopBa", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789138448743, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

